# purpose: M3 adds no commands; this is a short M1+M2 regression so the milestone has a golden of its own.
# exercises: deposits, withdrawals, a freeze window, a closure.
OPEN alice USD
OPEN bob USD
DEPOSIT alice 30
DEPOSIT bob 30
WITHDRAW alice 10
FREEZE bob
WITHDRAW bob 10
UNFREEZE bob
WITHDRAW bob 30
CLOSE bob
BALANCE alice
BALANCE bob
